<title>USA: TABLE - BetzDearborn Inc Q2 shr falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - BetzDearborn Inc Q2 shr falls.</headline>
<dateline>TREVOSE, Pa. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>						     June 30,  June 30,</p>
<p>					    1997    1996    1997   1996</p>
<p> Net sales			     $322.4 $210.1  $628.8 $409.6</p>
<p>Operating costs and expenses:</p>
<p>					    278.3  173.9   544.1  341.6</p>
<p>	 OPERATING EARNINGS	    44.1   36.2    84.7   68.0</p>
<p>	 NET EARNINGS		    21.1   22.3    39.7   42.0</p>
<p>Net earnings per Common Share:</p>
<p>   Primary				 0.67   0.75    1.26   1.41</p>
<p>   Fully diluted			 0.64   0.71    1.20   1.33</p>
<p>Average number of Common Shares:</p>
<p>   Primary				 29.5   28.0    29.3   27.9</p>
<p>   Fully diluted			 32.3   30.7    32.0   30.7</p>
<p>Excluding integration costs, net earnings for the quarter were a $26.7 million compared to $22.7 million for the same period last year. Fully diluted earnings per share, excluding integration costs, were $0.81 compared to $0.71.</p>
<p>Total integration costs for the quarter were $8.7 million. Net earnings for the quarter as reported were $21.1 million and fully diluted earnings per share were $0.64.</p>
